1
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:34,500
Why did I pull... my hands away?...

2
00:00:34,799 --> 00:00:41,670
What was the price... I couldn't pay?...

3
00:00:41,890 --> 00:00:48,799
Why do I freeze... when someone cares?...

4
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:56,799
Trapped in a house... of poisoned prayers?...

5
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:03,020
Red celluloid... against my chest...

6
00:01:03,200 --> 00:01:09,370
Is fear the only thing... I learned the best?...

7
00:01:09,569 --> 00:01:16,090
I hold the keys... but lock the door...

8
00:01:16,189 --> 00:01:27,040
Why do I hurt... the one I'm longing for?...

9
00:01:27,129 --> 00:01:34,019
Why is her warmth... a deadly sin?...

10
00:01:34,200 --> 00:01:40,980
Why does my father... always win?...

11
00:01:41,200 --> 00:01:47,980
A girl who gave me... light and grace...

12
00:01:48,200 --> 00:01:56,019
And all I gave her... was an empty place...

13
00:01:56,200 --> 00:02:03,019
How can I play... of love and fire...

14
00:02:03,200 --> 00:02:08,569
When I'm a coward... to my own desire?...

15
00:02:08,680 --> 00:02:15,280
The bellows ache... with all my shame...

16
00:02:15,340 --> 00:02:26,250
I run away... but still I call her name...

17
00:02:26,330 --> 00:02:33,020
Will I become... the stone I hate?...

18
00:02:33,199 --> 00:02:39,620
Am I already... bound to Albert's fate?...

19
00:02:39,800 --> 00:02:46,800
She offered truth... without a screen...

20
00:02:47,020 --> 00:02:55,020
Why did I run... from what I could have been?...

21
00:02:55,199 --> 00:03:01,439
What kind of man... leaves her in the cold?...

22
00:03:01,569 --> 00:03:07,590
To guard a lie... that makes me old?...

23
00:03:07,710 --> 00:03:14,599
The music bleeds... into the floor...

24
00:03:14,659 --> 00:03:26,379
I am the prisoner... who locked his own door...

25
00:03:39,330 --> 00:03:45,800
Why was I terrified... to love you, Ginger?...

26
00:03:46,199 --> 00:03:48,800
Why did I run?...

27
00:03:49,610 --> 00:03:52,300
Why did I run?...

28
00:03:53,550 --> 00:03:57,500
When I love you!